{"id":"00157","root":"uni00157_1","name":{"ja":"獅子神　自斎","en":"Shishigami Jisai"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"獅子神　自斎","en":"Shishigami Jisai"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-01-31","limited":false,"characterId":127,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。五車学園の学生。自然系忍法の中でも千年にひとりと謂われる神遁の術使い。神遁の術とは自然界に潜む超常のもの、一説には滅びし古き神々の力を借りる忍法とされる。そのため彼女の両目には神気が宿り、その両目で見詰めたものに恐ろしい祟りがあるという。その力はあまりに強力過ぎるため、常にその目は特殊な忍法を施したマスクで覆われている。マスク状態では彼女には周囲の状況が常人以上に感じ取る事ができる。それは彼女を護りし超常のものの助けがあるため。そういった事情から対魔忍の中においても彼女は恐れられ、また自らも人を遠ざけている。五車町近くの原生林の中に彼女が安らげる、すなわち両目を解放できる場所があるという。任務において単独行動が多い自斎であるが、その両目に宿りし超常の力を使用する事はほとんどない。それは彼女が逸刀流剣術の達人であるため。逸刀流皆伝の秋山凜子と匹敵する実力とされるが「超常の力が無ければ凜子先輩の足元に及ばない」と本人は素っ気なく否定する。","en":"Shishigami Jisai is a Taimanin and a student at Gosha Academy. She wields the legendary divine-stepping art, a nature-based ninjutsu said to appear only once every thousand years, which draws on the supernatural forces hidden in the natural world—or, according to some, the power of extinct ancient gods. Consequently, divine energy dwells in both of her eyes, and anyone she fixes with that gaze suffers a terrible curse. Because the power is so overwhelming, her eyes are constantly covered by a mask enchanted with a special ninjutsu. While masked, she perceives her surroundings more keenly than ordinary people, thanks to the aid of the supernatural entities that protect her. This makes her both feared among Taimanin and inclined to keep others at a distance. Near Gosha Town, within a primeval forest, lies a place where she can relax and release her eyes. Though she often operates alone on missions, she rarely taps the supernatural power in her eyes, relying instead on her mastery of the Ittō-ryū sword style. Her skill is said to rival that of Akiyama Rinko, a master of Ittō-ryū, but she bluntly dismisses the notion, claiming \"without supernatural power I can't even come close to senior Rinko's level.\""},"illustrator":"なまにくATK","voiceActor":